#6800
A Tropical Jungle~
   The ground beneath your feet is very moist and spongy, drops of water
falling from the great heights of the broad-leaf tree tops above you.
Bird calls echo constantly, the jungle teeming with all manner of life. The
tall peaks of a large mountain range prevent travel to the north while the
sound of the ocean lies directly to the west.
~
