A Tropical Jungle~
   A list mist fills the air which seems relatively calm, perhaps shielded
from outside weather influences by the trees around you. Scattered light
filters through the tops of the trees but it is difficult to tell what
time of day it is. The tall peaks of a large mountain range prevent travel
to the north.
