#6804
A Pleasant Waterfall~
   Shrouded within the jungle foliage, a small but steadily flowing waterfall
cascades from a point high above you, within the mountain tops themselves you
would imagine. It flows into a shallow river which winds its way to the south
before disappearing into the depths.
~
