A Tropical Jungle~
   It is so humid in this jungle that water droplets form on you every
time you stop to rest. The air is thick with moisture and you can almost
feel the weight of it on your shoulders. Perhaps you should press onward
before you become completely soaked. The tall peaks of a large mountain range
prevent travel to the north.
