#6944
A Gently Sloping Hill~
   Remarkable...a lush, tropical jungle lies just to the west and prompty
ends in a line of trees that runs to the north and south. Where you stand
now, an area has been cleared away, obviously to make room for the city
that lies to the east. A small earthen road enters the jungle to the west
and continues up to the east where it becomes paved.
   The city stables lie to the north, just outside the city limits.
~
