#6987
A Gently Sloping Hill~
   You stand at the corner of a small farm plot surrounded by a neat little
wooden fence. While you could clamber over the fence, you'd probably annoy
the farmer who stares at you intently from within the plot. Lush, tropical
jungle trees surround you to the west and south while the hill continues its
gentle slope down to the east.
