#6988
A Gently Sloping Hill~
   This area has been cleared of the jungle trees and has been divided into
a number of farming plots to the north and northeast. Beyond that, rising up
towards the sky, lies the foreboding walls of the city of Mist Keep. You
could enter the jungle to the south or progress along the hillside you are now
on to the west or east.
